Modifications added by this project
-----------------------------------
  * sync lock        - a [sync] table in pack.toml, enforced whenever an index
                       is written, so out-of-scope files never reach
                       index.toml (core/synclock.go, core/index.go)
  * modrinth scanner - "packwiz modrinth scan" turns local files into Modrinth
                       metadata (modrinth/scan.go)
  * client enforcer  - "packwiz sync" and "packwiz lock check --preflight"
                       (cmd/sync.go, cmd/lock.go, core/installplan.go)

